Subject: [PATCH] Diagnostic build: #347 read-only chest reward scoring
 (STS_347_CHEST_SCORE)

At each treasure reward screen with a relic, scores detached copies under
the live leaf models (screen GBM where it covers the screen, X2-B anchor):
the root, leaving at once, gold taken, gold+relic taken, and both after
leaving to the map. Writes JSONL; the live state is never touched.

